# vcrun + gdiplus/d3dcompiler) and their DllOverrides that make an Adobe prefix
# work, captured once from a proven prefix (`neutron runtime capture`) into a
# versioned bundle: <runtime>/dlls/{system32,syswow64}/*.dll + <runtime>/overrides.json.
# Resolution mirrors the wine runtime (env -> dist -> repo-local). Binaries are
# NOT committed to git; they're a build/runtime artifact.
