# --- WebView2 runtime (Adobe in-app sign-in / IMS is a Microsoft Edge WebView2
# web UI). The Adobe installer drops WebView2 files under Common Files\Adobe but
# never REGISTERS the runtime, so the app's WebView2 loader can't find it and the
# sign-in window renders BLANK (a big time-sink to diagnose — bank it). provision
# stages a complete *registered* runtime to the standard path AND writes the
# EdgeUpdate\Clients\{GUID} "pv" the loader reads (both the 64-bit view and
# Wow6432Node — the Adobe licensing helper is 32-bit). Binary is a runtime
# artifact (like the DLL bundle), NOT committed to git.
