# ⛔ dxcore and dcomp were REMOVED here 2026-08-07. They used to be staged as `native` because the
# patched versions had to be supplied as files; that is obsolete — a wineboot on 11.10-22+ is a
# SELF-HEAL that installs the runtime's own PATCHED dcomp/dxcore/dwrite builtins (verified by
# marker, not size: wiki APPS.md prefix registry). Re-adding them is not merely redundant:
# wiki APPS.md records "do NOT re-add dcomp/dxcore/nvapi64 — they black-box PS 2026" (that note is
# about the photoshop app profile, but the prefix-wide case points the same way). The live
# ~/.premiere2025, which runs all seven apps, has NEITHER override.
#
# This mattered because these only fire on the `builtin-minimal` path — when no runtime bundle is
# present — which is exactly a fresh tester's first provision. The bundle-derived path never had
# them, so the defect was invisible on any machine that had already captured a bundle.
# HKCU\Software\Wine\Fonts\Replacements — map the fonts Adobe requests but that
# can't ship (MS Segoe/Calibri, CJK Noto/MS) onto Adobe Clean (installed with the
