        # NEUTRON_D2D_CLIPCHILDREN is deliberately absent: it defaults to ON and only accepts "0"
        # to disable, so passing "1" was always inert.
        # ⚠️ Comments in a harness are not a specification. Check what a flag GATES in the source
        # before calling it unnecessary — "undocumented" is not "unused".
